- Use React Native with Expo
- Use TypeScript
- Use Supabase or Firebase for backend
- Follow clean architecture and multi-tenancy for SaaS
- All estimates must be real-time, timestamped, with confidence factors
- Include flyovers, AI Vision, LLM Chat, Automatic Deal Scanner with LLM scoring
- Implement full security best practices and feature gating from PRD v2.0
- Use Tailwind or NativeWind for styling
- Enforce subscription checks on all paid features